description	"Underworld Smuggler

Quick flankers with illegal weaponry.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
-- 10% Faster Swings
-- 15% Faster Movement Speed
- Vibrosaber
-- Low Damage (125)
-- Dual Vibrosabers (Duals)
-- Single Vibrosaber (Cyan/Blue)
- Modified Heavy Blaster 
-- Mando Pistol
-- 25%+ Damage
-- 35%- Rate Of Fire
-- Mag Reload

^8Attributes:
- Dexterity (1)
- Assemble (3)
- Ammo (3)

^3Abilities:
- Combat Roll ^3[CS2]
- Dodge (2) ^3[CS1]
- Gunkick ^3[CS3]
- Grapple Hook ^3[CS4]"
